# Fixed defect 130, 2026-09-28, a body that is not there. Symptom: a head with
# no body at all, `while n > 0` over a line at its own margin, was named
# `missing_body` at that line, and the line itself, `z = 4 )`, was then dropped
# with its mistake. Cause: looking for the body, the head had consumed its own
# line end, and `grammar_expr.finish`, keyed on the report, dropped the next
# line as if it were the rest of the head's. The line after a head whose body
# is missing is read as the statement it is.

function missing(n: i64)
    while n > 0
    z = 4 )  #~ missing_body #~ expected_end_of_line

function main()
    missing(1)
